---
title: lavender lemonade cocktail
description: Light, refreshing, and floral, this cocktail is easy to make and even easier to drink!
source_url: https://www.cakenknife.com/wprm_print/lavender-lemonade-cocktail
servings: 8
---

Mix @lemon juice{1 1/2%cups}, @lavender simple syrup{1%cup}, @vodka{2%cups}, and @water{5%cups} in a large #pitcher{}.

Chill in the refrigerator for ~{120-180%minutes} before serving.

Serve in glasses filled with ice.
